Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}A morning hello is no big deal!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:22.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Morning! Tee-hee!\NVamola! Ya doin' well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:23.41,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I practiced the heck out of it\Nlast night! I got this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:27.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't let her catch on\Nthat I'm a morning hello amateur!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hold on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though we became friends,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:50.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}would she suddenly start waiting for me\Nat the school gate?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:53.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She must be waiting for someone else!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:53.69,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:01.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}The correct answer is to ignore her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:12.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're late. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:51.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And that alien was saying\Nthere were only men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:53.40,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(591.666667,180)}EPISODE 5\NLIKE, WHERE ARE YOU BALLS?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They come here from super far away\Non a UFO, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:58.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That UFO must've been totally musty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:02.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wonder what they normally eat.\NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:06.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll chat again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:10.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, later...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That hurt, damn you!\NYou're in the way, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:23.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you hurry up and step aside?\NYou're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:44.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is nothing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:49.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how brutal people may be,\NI can forgive them all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I know...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}that I now have a wonderful friend!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay! Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:04.34,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall forgive them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No good. Totes zoned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's def acting weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:22.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was wondering why she didn't return\Nmy messages. She said she lost her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And she wasn't at school yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Maybe she went to see\Nthat ex-boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:28.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wow, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:32.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And he rejected her flat-out so she stopped\Ncaring about stuff and broke her phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's so possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here it comes! Agony time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's when she remembers the past\Nand writhes about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:49.26,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,THE POWER TO LIVE!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:49.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanna talk about aliens.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:51.47,BD Top Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,CRAB + TURBO G\NUMA? SPIRITUAL PHENOMENON?\NFRESHWATER CRAB?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:53.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to talk to Miss Ayase!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to talk about ghosts!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:58.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was at my wit's end in the morning,\Nand couldn't talk at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:01.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase asked me\Nall sorts of questions, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to talk to Okarun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do the aliens\Nthat assaulted us usually eat?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}And do they even wear underwear?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:12.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}You idiot, Ken! You moron!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to talk to Okarun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must hurry and recover our relationship,\Nor she'll hate me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanna talk, I wanna talk to him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.79,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SPIRITUAL PHENOMENON\NASSAULTING ALIENS ONLY HAVE MALES\NWHAT DO THEY USUALLY EAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! It's Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell us his name. Real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't possibly say his name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Bring me the boy with glasses\Nwho likes the occult!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:07.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Was anyone interested in the occult?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's lunchtime,\Nso maybe he's at the cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is Miss Ayase here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Who? I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe she's at the cafeteria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:20.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like Okarun would go\Nto such a rowdy place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's at the school store. The co-op!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Co-op?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:26.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll drop by after I check the cafeteria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:35.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's not here. I should try the co-op.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I'll try the cafeteria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nowhere to be found.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:55.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's avoiding me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:58.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She realized this morning how boring I am{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:00.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}and must've thought\Nthat I'm a pain in the butt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, where are you, Okarun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:05.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lunch break is gonna be over soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the worst.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:14.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think,\Nhe was pretty lifeless this morning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:17.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe he doesn't like people\Ngetting in his face?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:22.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I wasn't earnestly thinking\Nabout Okarun's feelings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:30.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase has so many friends, so I guess\NI'm just a friend candidate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:34.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe he's avoiding me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:39.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I don't even count as a friend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm totes feelin' the blues.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:04.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was conceited.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why am I such a wimp?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why am I always like this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Miss Ayase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Okarun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:15.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:16.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I found you, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.97,0:08:18.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:24.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch! Like, I heard teeth clashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:28.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was searching for you\Nthe whole time, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And that's my line!\NDon't be wandering around so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:34.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was! And break is almost over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:40.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd thought that you were completely\Navoiding me, Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:43.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's what I was thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? This is turning really awkward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to change the topic fast!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They were kissing just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:56.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, Momo.\NYou totes shoulda told us sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that's why\Nyou've been acting so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:01.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! I'd never kiss\Na dimwit like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right! I'd never do that\Nwith a stupid person like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't got the right\Nto reject, you baldie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:10.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not bald!\NCan you even see properly!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How lame! A serious answer!\NYou're so lame, damn four-eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:17.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay! You just antagonized every\Nsingle person wearing glasses in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:20.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk to you, okay?\NDon't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:23.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said it! You better not talk to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:29.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Those two really get along!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:37.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't help retort to her provoking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are so many things\NI want to talk to her about.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to properly apologize.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:45.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:48.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:51.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo! I heard you were kissing\Nin the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What kinda guy is he? Which class?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:57.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said, it's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, he's an otaku,\Nand a total four-eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't you run off with the story!\N- Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There he is! That's the bae!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:08.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,he's not my...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, I have to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:14.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, there's a major issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said I didn't wanna talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:22.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shoo! Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's something important!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:34.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We start off with a bloodbath?\NI pity your bae!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:37.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As. I. Said.\NHe's not a boyfriend or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:39.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't spread strange rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:43.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! You talked a whole bunch\Nto me this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:45.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why won't you talk to me at all now!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:47.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said you didn't want\Nto talk to me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:50.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was just provoked,\Nso it was just a retort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:55.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,To be honest, I just wanted to talk to you\Nmore than anything, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:56.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Quite the words!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:58.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Go for it, Otaku-kun!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:01.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When I say I don't want to,\NI don't want to! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:04.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wow, how cold. That's so brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys are the brutal ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:15.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So is it that embarrassing\Nto be friendly to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:25.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't have to go all-out\Nto reject him, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:29.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If he's just a friend, you'd let it slide\Nwith a wisecrack like you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if Miss Ayase\Nalready went home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:52.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:12:00.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have a water bottle in my bag.\NI hope it didn't hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:04.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh no, not at all.\NMaybe it's because I've been working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:06.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was totally my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:12.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,P-Please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:15.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, I feel so bummed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like I'm the bad guy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I was the one at fault.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:38.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Didn't he say he had no friends?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}And she's kinda cute, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:46.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:50.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That otaku had such\Na dumb look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He totally fell for me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He must be head over heels\Nfor me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're such a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? I mean, it's so fun\Nwhen scum fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.01,0:13:04.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure a guy like that never had\Na decent conversation with a girl, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:08.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And he probably will never\Nbe touched by a cute girl like me ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm letting him dream,\Nso isn't that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:15.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure that four-eyed otaku\Nis happy now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Aira!\N- You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But wait, why a washtub?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:28.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That fell from directly above us,\Ndidn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:30.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? That girl from earlier has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:34.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Did the impact of bumping into me\Nhave a delayed effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,M-Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! Let's go home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:46.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you're really looking sharp\Nas usual with those glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:50.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I guess stupid girls will never\Nunderstand your charm, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:54.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Some are more fit to have washtubs\Nfalling on their heads than guys falling for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:14.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I had the worst attitude towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:22.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In the courtyard, after that incident\Nthat was like a kiss, I got all flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:29.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not embarrassed about\Nbeing friendly to you, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, it's fine! I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:37.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like, I'm very happy that\NI could make amends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:47.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway that's trivial.\NI have a huge problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:52.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what do you mean trivial?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was agonizing a lot about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.41,0:14:56.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please calm down and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You know how we defeated\NTurbo Granny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We did beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We even visited a shrine afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:05.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your curse is gone,\Nand your thing is back too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:09.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:09.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My balls are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.43,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why I told you to show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:19.14,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,To begin with, why didn't you notice?\NThose are your balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:21.19,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, you're laughing too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:26.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, the shaft was back, so I felt\Nreassured and didn't notice the balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shaft? Stop making it sound\Nlike it's something glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:32.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yours is nothing more than a pencil!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:33.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've never seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No choice. Gotta take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? You're going to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna look at your wiener!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna peek into your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo! Bring me a doll, I don't care what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Also, bring a washing bin and some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:56.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's something hiding inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.48,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY\NWARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:06.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You put the talisman on the doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:11.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,dumb-dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What is this? Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't move. Don't talk.\NYou rotten tangerine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:23.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you completely\Nfooling around right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:26.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The lines in the kanji for "person"\Nsupport each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay! You are fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:31.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides, Kinpachi-sensei\Nwould never say "rotten tangerine"!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, did you get a glimpse of anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:41.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right when Okarun got smacked,\Nthe aura changed for an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, Momo. Help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:47.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The instant the aura changes colors,\Npull out that aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:49.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can pull out a human aura?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It won't be his.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If it's something foreign,\Nyou should be able to pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:54.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Concentrate, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:16:59.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:06.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:08.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I felt it just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Once I pulled it out, it disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap, Grandma! I might've let it escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait up, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It went that way! Come on, catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So fast! Seriously, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where did you go, rotten tangerine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:47.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is that cat?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:48.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's probably here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go of me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:10.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll kill all three of ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your psychic powers have evolved!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:17.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah! How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:20.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come at me!\N- So, who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on, come on!\N- Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well that's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:32.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But we defeated Turbo Granny!\NShe went to the afterlife, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:35.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who'd be defeated\Nby some youngins like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:37.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the elderly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Doesn't she look kind of cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:41.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I just told you\Nto not underestimate me, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:44.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In that instant I was getting burnt\Nby the barrier spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I switched to astral form\Nas if I was swimming in the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and possessed the boy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:55.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As I was close to being diminished, I was able\Nto completely sever my presence within his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:59.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was hiding inside him as I waited\Nfor my spiritual powers to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:03.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd been thinking, when the time comes,\Nthat I'll kill both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:06.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're still gonna go at it?\NYou've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:11.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I haven't lost!\NThere's no way I'd lose, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Especially you!\NYou're not getting away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:19.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll snap all your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you understand your current situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're the ones with the advantage here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:28.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You told us too much\Nabout what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:31.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right! Hand the balls over!\NGimme my balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:38.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be thinking\Nabout defeating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:43.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I die, your balls\Nwill never go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:48.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You morons finally understand\Nthe situation now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:53.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm the only one\Nwith the advantage here, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:56.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So for now, boy, bring a kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:58.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And kill these two bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:00.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll give your balls back to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:01.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:06.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have no choice but to obey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:08.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:25.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stuff like that is too much stress.\NMakes me wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:30.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Why? We drove Turbo Granny out,\Nso why can you transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Impossible! What's going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:38.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This paper fan is used to drive evil spirits\Noutta people's bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You seem to have been\Ntrying really hard to cling on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:45.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,because it looks like only\NGranny's consciousness came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Which means, your spiritual power\Nis still remaining inside the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:51.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and just the consciousness\Nwas transferred into the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:56.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm the only one who can\Nreturn the consciousness to its original place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:21:01.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But didn't you face Kinpachi here\Nand call me an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You dumb-dumb cat-turd rotten tangerine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:09.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not your Sensei, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:11.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you really are cool Seiko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:14.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The hell you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:15.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was amazing!\NHow did you transform?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Well, I don't know.\N- Scurry, scurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:25.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I really got pissed and felt\NI just couldn't forgive her, and I had transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.51,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get back here! Don't you be\Nrunning away, punk! You damn cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:25.72,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Ouch!\N- Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:29.39,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You dumb-dumb! You rotten tangerine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:30.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's enough. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:36.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're really petty, but to be honest,\NI can't really hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:40.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The feeling of sympathy for those girls\Nis the same, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:42.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So let's be a bit friendly here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:47.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you give the balls back,\Nwe'll return you your powers. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:49.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:57.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:21:59.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and give the balls back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:01.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:05.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:07.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hurry up and—\N- I don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:11.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,His balls?\NI dropped them somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:44.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:45.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.57,0:23:47.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:50.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Humans are creatures that\Njust accidentally mutter "danger" sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.91,0:23:52.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:53.74,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 6\NA DANGEROUS WOMAN ARRIVES
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.32,0:23:53.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"A Dangerous Woman Arrives."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.91,0:23:55.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I'm asking you,\Nwhat's so dangerous?
